- Approved Overtime
- Double Duty
- Holiday Duty
- Bonus
- Incentives
- Reimbursements

B. DEDUCTIONS

- Advance Recovery
- Uniform Deduction
- Equipment Deduction
- Approved Employee Debit
- Employee PF Contribution, where applicable
- Employee ESI Contribution, where applicable
- Professional Tax, where applicable
- TDS, where applicable
- Other Authorized Deductions

C. FINAL CALCULATION

Gross Earnings = Sum of all applicable earnings.

Net Payable = Gross Earnings - Total Deductions.

Employer statutory contributions must be separately displayed and must not be incorrectly deducted from employee net salary.

Every salary component must have a clear calculation breakdown.

